    "body": "Yes - I think what's likely to happen is that the `prefetch.i` will prime the L2 to prefetch the line, and so will probably have nothing to do with the I$ directly.\r\n\r\nHow would you fix the justification? It's not reasonable to _require_ the LSU to do the PCC bounds check.\r\n",
